# The kit's public boundary is Objective-C and Neo-prefixed C constants.
# glslang/SPIRV-Cross are private implementations. Exporting their weak C++
# instantiations lets dyld coalesce them with incompatible embedded copies
# (in particular DolphinCore's older glslang allocator and AST).
_OBJC_CLASS_$_Neo*
_OBJC_METACLASS_$_Neo*
_OBJC_IVAR_$_Neo*
_Neo*
_neo_shader_kitVersion*
